+| Screw tip to maximum pack | 2.30 | **1.86**, in addition to intact barrier; no pouch penetration |
+| Nut (AF5.5 × 2.4 envelope) | 8.6..11.0 | Pocket AF5.8, Z8.3..11.0; gauge actual fit |
